        "x1": 0.643605599995532,
        "y1": 0.7572727010707663
      },
      "text": "where p is prime and η > 0 has at most M (k) prime factors.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6521539625778697,
        "y0": 0.7446936104032729,
        "x1": 0.7929377337686376,
        "y1": 0.7572727010707663
      },
      "text": "Here, M (k) = 6k is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2070553848166871,
        "y0": 0.759845125554788,
        "x1": 0.7685066173279208,
        "y1": 0.7724242162222814
      },
      "text": "admissible for all even k ≥ 2, and M (k) = 4k is admissible for all odd k ≥ 3.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7776426926157833,
        "y0": 0.759845125554788,
        "x1": 0.7931328567804075,
        "y1": 0.7724242162222814
      },
      "text": "In",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
